# rc.3 real sign-in pages, 2026-11-21. Split computer, v2 delivery, made-up
# logins only (no real account, nothing submitted with a password). Driven as
# the agent: browser navigate / text / fill NAME.username|password, then text,
# tabs and screenshot read back. rc.3 = hotline-computer:0.13.0-rc.3 rebuilt
# from cd197d6; fix = the same tree with this branch's fill change.
# user/password: typed (T), refused (R, with why), not reached (-).
# read-back: whether the password showed in text, tabs or a screenshot after
# the fill (the username stays readable by design).
